Subject: [PATCH] Complete token authority and validate registry state before handover
Base: components/ccip @ 501bdc31118a16de859985a4ee7cce906edd588f

WHY: Register fresh tokens before transferring CCIP administration to the DAO,
validate token and registry authority before handing pools to POM, and support
legacy configuration and idempotent handover retries. Share explicit-path
configuration loading with rehearsals. POM bytecode is unchanged.

